TITLE Albite kinetics with H2S gas; track Fe(3) step 10 vs 100
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Fe(2) 4
    Fe(3) 4
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10 10
        -tol 1e-12
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals Fe
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Fe3_molal
10 PUNCH MOL("Fe+3")
END
